      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسبق القَوْمُ إِلَى الأَمْرِ</span></b>  [perhaps a mistranscription for ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استبق</span></b> ] <i>The people,</i> or <i>party,
